>You only need to compile the libs and binaries you need debuging output
>from.
>From what you already wrote it seems to be libalias and ppp.
>Simply go into the src dir of the compent you need and
>make obj all install.

Remember to install the libraries before ppp...  I'd also suggest
statically linking ppp - add "CFLAGS += -static" to
/usr/src/usr.sbin/ppp/Makefile.  This will ensure that the library
debug symbols are available to gdb.

Peter

